      "text": "输入\n                            5 5 3\r\n5 5 5 5 5\r\n5 1 5 1 5\r\n5 5 5 5 5\r\n5 2 5 2 5\r\n3 5 5 5 2\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            40"
